input b: Tensor[batch=B, channel=3, height=224, width=224]
graph g { return a }

### BND-PAR-004 | call arg-count extreme: conv2d's 5-arg call (3 positional + 2 keyword)
graph g {
  a = conv2d(image, W, b, stride=1, padding=1)
  return a
}
